[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3798290156","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115381#issuecomment-3798290156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115381","id":3798290156,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iZU7s","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T07:53:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T07:53:47Z","body":"Please note that there may be a bug in the core. It's somewhat odd that `ResourceFormatLoaderGDScript` is called for the original path, which has an extension not supported by the loader (because the actual path is checked, not the original one). However, I didn't investigate this possibility due to the scale of the implications.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d5edd4a59287679ae390149c0c1c3397aeb5f502/core/io/resource_loader.cpp#L306-L318\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d5edd4a59287679ae390149c0c1c3397aeb5f502/modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp#L2918-L2921","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3798290156/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801618328","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115381#issuecomment-3801618328","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115381","id":3801618328,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7imBeY","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T20:30:20Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T20:35:38Z","body":"The main issue I have with this, is that it will result in a state were the `GDScriptCache` and `ResourceCache` reference the script with different paths. Desyncs between the both caches were responsible for script duplication issues in the editor. Without further investigation I'm not confident that replacing the 1:1 mapping of keys, with a `gdscript_key = import_remap(resource_key)` mapping is safe. And even if so, it would add even more mental overhead to the system.\r\n\r\nIMO if we want to support this on a best effort basis we should use the `.test` path for the cache and use `import_remap` in addition to `path_remap`. If we are not comfortable with this (because of all the hardcoded extension checks that might not take remapping into account) we should just detect the case and throw an explicit error: \"GDScript code generation should not be done in the context of the import system. GDScript needs a canonical `.gd` file in the project.\"","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801618328/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801769472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115381#issuecomment-3801769472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115381","id":3801769472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7immYA","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T21:10:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T21:53:09Z","body":"> If we are not comfortable with this (because of all the hardcoded extension checks that might not take remapping into account) we should just detect the case and throw an explicit error\r\n\r\nI had this idea, but I'm unsure about choosing between strict behavior and best effort support (without guarantees the absence of weird bugs). I submitted this PR as is because: 1. the issue is labeled as a regression, and 2. at first glance, this fix looks like it should work.\r\n\r\nGiven that you also support a stricter option, I'll probably update the PR as you suggested. This also makes sense in the long term (if we abandon the \"script is a resource\" approach in Godot 5).\r\n\r\nHowever, we still face the question: should we make this a strict error or just a warning? For example, we could use the `WARN_PRINT_ONCE` macro to warn the user about an unsupported file extension and still attempt to gracefully handle this case, albeit without guarantees of correct cache system operation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801769472/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801875553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115381#issuecomment-3801875553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115381","id":3801875553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7inARh","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T21:37:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T21:37:08Z","body":"I think the best middle ground right now would be:\r\n\r\n- print a warning\r\n- add a comment that explains that the code is on best effort basis (otherwise someone will try to fix or rework something and will carry this as tech debt into other parts of the code)\r\n- use `import_remap` over `p_path`\r\n  - p_path is also `path_remap`ed, so it could in theory point to a `.gdc` file\r\n  - so only import remapping `p_original_path` feels like the solution which is most faithful to our existing code to me","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801875553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6077046839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115381#issuecomment-6077046839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115381","id":6077046839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABajhgNw","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T08:08:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T08:08:59Z","body":"I have no desire to continue working on this PR. Feel free to use it as a basis (crediting me as a co-author) if you wish.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6077046839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]